    "chunk_text": "\u00feeos \u00ferowung fram me, sy Com \u00f0a eft to his gingrum & mette hie sl\u00e6pende, for\u00feon \u00fee hi w\u00e6ron swi\u00fee gehefgude mid \u00fe\u00e6re Eode \u00fea \u00f0riddan si\u00f0e & geb\u00e6d hine mid \u00feam ylcan wordum. Cwom \u00fea eft to his gingerum, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, Slapa\u00f0 ge nu \u00fea, & r\u00e6sta\u00f0 eow, for\u00feon nu neal\u00e6ce\u00f0 seo Arisa\u00f0 nu, & utun gaan, for\u00feon \u00fee nu neal\u00e6ce\u00f0 se \u00f0e me gesealdne h\u00e6f\u00f0. \u00d0a eode se Iuda ut, & he hine l\u00e6dde to \u00fean ungeafullan heap Iudea folces \u00fea w\u00e6ron mid sweordum & \u00dea sealde se Iuda him \u00fe\u00e6t to beacne, & he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Witon ge \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00fee ic cessende beon, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t is se \u00dea w\u00e6s an stow \u00fee h\u00e6lend lufode sundorlice \u00fea f\u00e6stentid. \u00dea wolde he \u00fea stowe gegan \u00e6r \u00feon \u00fee hi hine namon. \u00dea he him eft to geeode, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him h\u00e6lend to, Hw\u00e6t seca\u00f0 ge? \u00deane Natarenisca h\u00e6lend. To so\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fe\u00e6t eom. \u00dea urnon hi underb\u00e6c & afeollon, & he eode for\u00f0, singende his gingeran. \u00dea hie him to geeodun, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him eft h\u00e6lend to, Hw\u00e6ne seca\u00f0 ge? \u00dea cw\u00e6don hie, \u00feisne h\u00e6lend, \u00feone galileiscan h\u00e6lend. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, So\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fe\u00e6t eom. \u00dea urnon h",
